{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Sakura Wars: The Radiant Gorgeous Blooming Cherry Blossoms","The end of the demon wars has ended and now the Flower Division has been able to rest up after their fighting. The second Sakura Wars develops studies on every Flower Division Combatee in every episode while they go on their miscellaneous adventures around Japan.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network, edited)"],"ja":["サクラ大戦 轟華絢爛",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":1165,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":608,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-1166","ids":{"shikimori":1166,"mal":1166,"anilist":1166,"kodik":"serial-28506"},"kodikIds":["serial-28507","serial-28506"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28507":"2020-08-08T15:19:26Z","serial-28506":"2020-08-08T15:18:22Z"},"title":"Сакура: Война миров II","originalTitle":"Sakura Taisen: Gouka Kenran","alt":"サクラ大戦 轟華絢爛 Sakura Wars: The Radiant Gorgeous Blooming Cherry Blossoms サクラ大戦 轟華絢爛","description":"Демонические войны позади, и теперь бойцы «Отряда цветов» наконец могут перевести дух после долгих сражений. Второй сезон «Войн Сакуры» в каждой серии подробно раскрывает историю одного из членов отряда, пока девушки переживают разнообразные приключения по всей Японии.","year":1999,"type":"OVA","genres":["Приключения","Фантастика","Повседневность","меха","исполнителское искусство"],"rating":6.91,"popularity":2077,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[1165,608],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1166/332e722a4c8a1fbafc09afffa9f3a3dd.jpeg","width":270,"height":385},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/b8677b51111f3d163884b29ed62342510a908fc0.jpg","width":960,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":2,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-829","dubId":"829","label":"Animegroup","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kod